title: Fight for attention
new-page: true

= Fight for attention

The alliance has spokespeople, friendly journalists and social accounts. It
does not possess an ecosystem capable of setting the national agenda every day.

- @press_room
- @hostile
- @local
- @movements
- @party_channel
- @poland_hub: Spend no action

@press_room
title: Build a professional rapid-response desk
subtitle: Cost: 2 resources. The most durable early investment.
choose-if: resources >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 2; month_actions += 1; media_capacity += 10; public_trust += 2; news_headline = "The Left answers before tomorrow's newspapers"

Researchers, regional press officers and broadcast training are less glamorous
than a television station. They also begin working this month.

- @poland_hub: Return to the leadership table

@hostile
title: Accept a hostile long-form interview
subtitle: Free, but preparation determines the result; three-month cooldown.
choose-if: hostile_interview_cooldown = 0
unavailable-subtitle: No major hostile platform is offering another interview yet.
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.hostile_interview_cooldown = 3;
if (Q.media_capacity >= 25) {
    Q.hostile_interview_success = 1;
    Q.left_poll += 0.5;
    Q.public_trust += 4;
    Q.media_capacity += 2;
    Q.news_headline = "A hostile interview becomes an unlikely victory";
} else {
    Q.hostile_interview_success = 0;
    Q.left_poll -= 0.4;
    Q.party_unity -= 3;
    Q.progressives_dissent += 3;
    Q.barons_dissent += 2;
    Q.news_headline = "One evasive answer becomes a week of clips";
}
!}

[? if hostile_interview_success = 1: The spokesperson answers the difficult
question, concedes uncertainty and returns to material policy. The hostile
audience does not become friendly, but competence travels beyond the Left's
bubble. ?]

[? if hostile_interview_success = 0: Nobody prepared the obvious coalition
question. Rival clips define the interview before the party publishes its own
version, and factions blame one another for the booking. ?]

- @poland_hub: Return to the leadership table

@local
title: Send recognisable figures through local media
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Modest national reach, durable local trust.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; month_actions += 1; local_network += 6; media_capacity += 3; left_poll += 0.3; barons_dissent -= 2; news_headline = "The campaign leaves Warsaw"

Local radio asks about a hospital and a bus route rather than the day's
coalition quarrel. Regional organisers acquire useful footage and a reason to
answer headquarters' calls.

- @poland_hub: Return to the leadership table

@movements
title: Amplify independent movement voices
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Trust without editorial control.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; month_actions += 1; feminist_trust += 5; movement_autonomy += 6; progressive_credibility += 3; media_capacity += 2; party_unity -= 1; news_headline = "Independent allies refuse to read party copy"

Organisers receive production help and retain the right to criticise the
alliance. Headquarters dislikes the second part. It is also why audiences
believe them.

- @poland_hub: Return to the leadership table

@party_channel
title: Launch an openly partisan video channel
subtitle: Cost: 2 resources. Reliable output with a credibility ceiling.
choose-if: resources >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 2; month_actions += 1; media_capacity += 7; public_trust -= 2; barons_strength += 1; news_headline = "The party can finally broadcast to itself"

The channel produces clean clips, regular briefings and almost no accidental
dissent. Most viewers already planned to vote Left.

- @poland_hub: Return to the leadership table
